//! VERBATIM at the pin THIS batch (full clone; master sat +9 past the pin
//! -- 5 substantive K8V4-warp/fusion/verify-tree commits + 4 docs -- all
//! read and adjudicated: the K8V4 warp trio merges into LEAD-5's regime
//! clause, the `RMSNorm` fusion is a positive-instance drop, the verify-tree
